Note: this repository ships no verbatim upstream source files. The SP-prefill
applier (patches/apply_sp_prefill.py) is original tooling that INJECTS code
derived from Apache-2.0 vLLM-lineage modules into your installed vLLM tree at
apply time; the injected module carries its upstream SPDX-License-Identifier:
Apache-2.0 header, and the edited files in your tree remain under their
upstream licenses. The MIT license above covers the scripts and documentation
in this repository.
